{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ii09a6KOoL1792751230.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產大埔康樂園分行高級資深分區營業經理吳啟業表示，近期整體租賃交投持續向好，大埔昌運中心最新錄2座中層F室，單位實用面積339平方呎，2房間隔，日前議價後以13,500元租出，實用平均呎租約39.8元。<br/>據了解，新租客為家庭客，見屋苑環境舒適，少有放盤，即決定以租入單位自用。據了解，業主於1988年以37萬元購入單位，是次租出單位可享44厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:22:51.149612+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T23:38:06.616504+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:18:10.068210+00:00","content_hash":"c1b57ac8f123d5671fe58cfe875d857b2e9e7b40101c317b1f4d65b9a13ca70a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}